license: MIT
keywords:
  - counterfactual explanations
  - explainable AI
  - medical imaging
  - StyleGAN2-ADA
  - Pivotal Tuning Inversion
  - PIECE
  - adversarial robustness
  - deep learning
abstract: >-
  SPRUCE is a framework for generating sparse, realistic, classifier-guided
  counterfactual explanations for medical images while uncoupling the training
  of the counterfactual explainer from the classifier under inspection.
